[00:30.73] (When I was young and lost)
[00:36.73] (you showed up and had my doors unlocked)
[00:44.95] (Like threads, petals unfold, a red kawara-nadeshiko)
[00:58.80] (You have shown me that)
[01:03.40] (I am still capable of caring for someone else)
[01:14.01] (That I still bear the same innocence inside)
[01:26.74] ('Cause now I know that pain cannot define the past)
[01:32.30] (We are built to overcome endless mishaps)
[01:37.30] (You know it is not so bad)
[01:40.44] (when you are with me)
[01:43.62] [Cherish as long as we last 'cause ]S[ is not for] sayonara
[01:52.57] (Let memories play back)
[01:57.20] 
[02:23.21] (I knew I must step up)
[02:30.13] (You deserve the world and more)
[02:37.32] (The truth is that you'd rather spend our limited time together)
[02:51.53] (Protection alone is not enough)
[02:59.51] (Providing cannot fill an empty cup thirsting for love)
[03:10.34] (I questioned myself a lot)
[03:21.01] 
[03:43.98] What do I know about love?
[03:46.60] How can I recreate what I've never had?
[03:51.68] All I know is that I must keep you thriving
[03:57.88] If nutrients are what you lack
[04:01.45] I will water you with every drop of blood I have
[04:10.34] But now I know that sacrifice is the easy path
[04:15.89] My absence cannot ever change the fact
[04:20.74] I wanted the very best 
[04:26.14] for you, believe me
[04:27.11] Our threads in red can never be cut and S is not for sayonara
[04:35.99] Will you forgive me at last?
